      "category": "Finance",
      "type": "actionable",
      "headline": "Retract Your Shoulder Blades on Bench",
      "body": "Lying flat on a bench without pinching your shoulder blades together puts your rotator cuffs at risk and ruins power transfer. Retracting and depressing your scapulae builds a solid shelf and protects your shoulders.",
