      "category": "Finance",
      "type": "concept",
      "headline": "Power Cleans Train Explosive Force",
      "body": "Lifting slow weights builds raw force, but power cleans teach you to express that force fast. Snapping a bar from the floor to your shoulders trains motor-unit recruitment and athletic explosive power.",
