      "category": "Finance",
      "type": "actionable",
      "headline": "Rest 3 to 5 Minutes Between Heavy Sets",
      "body": "Resting only 60 seconds turns strength training into sloppy cardio. To build maximum neural force and complete all 5 reps with pristine form, your ATP-CP system needs full recovery time between work sets.",
